This package named nav2_collision_monitor is the overlay of the ROSlean
repository: the Lean-backed collision monitor under upstream's package name.
It is not upstream's nav2_collision_monitor. See docs/DROP_IN_COLLISION_MONITOR.md
in https://github.com/Beneficial-AI-Foundation/ROSlean.

The tests of roslean_collision_monitor look for this file and refuse to take
this package for upstream's.
